{
  "info": {
    "name": "ColdTrace API",
    "_postman_id": "8f6d2b9e-5c1a-4e0b-9a51-c0d7ace0001a",
    "description": "Tests of the ColdTrace REST API (https://api.coldtrace.test) and login server (https://iam.coldtrace.test).\n\n1. Import this collection and ColdTrace-dev.postman_environment.json, select the environment.\n2. Set `adminPassword` from gateway-iot/.env (IAM_ADMIN_PASSWORD).\n3. Run the whole collection (Runner) or `newman run docs/postman/ColdTrace.postman_collection.json -e docs/postman/ColdTrace-dev.postman_environment.json --env-var adminPassword=...`.\n\nThe login requests save the token; every other request sends it (Authorization: Bearer). The Catalog folder creates and then deactivates a test site `pm-site` and sensor `PM01` (deactivation keeps history; the ids stay registered, so a second run expects 409 on create and continues). The development CA must be trusted, or turn off SSL certificate verification in Postman's settings for the .test names.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "from",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "to",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "incidentId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Login (IAM)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Public key (no login)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{iamUrl}}/auth/public-key",
              "host": [
                "{{iamUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "public-key"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"PEM\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.include(\"BEGIN PUBLIC KEY\"));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Wrong password is refused",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{iamUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{iamUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{adminUser}}\",\n  \"password\": \"not-the-password\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"status 401\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login as admin",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{iamUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{iamUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{adminUser}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"admin role\", () => pm.expect(body.user.roles).to.include(\"admin\"));",
                  "pm.environment.set(\"token\", body.accessToken);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Who am I",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{iamUrl}}/auth/me",
              "host": [
                "{{iamUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "me"
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"same user\", () => pm.expect(body.username).to.eql(pm.environment.get(\"adminUser\")));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
